  "bg-canonical/0051649d84e5e3525b2119649803b3fb8cc57cd64d1d1b1f513ce814a6d5c261.webp": ["The dog is still keen. The dog is always keen. Respect.","Even the dog's breath is showing. That's the reading.","Frost already forming and the sun barely down: tonight means business."],
  "bg-canonical/00989238a8dce054e9e41f24d5842ce5a5f90540d5cb7777662ff15df60e77f0.webp": ["Your breath is doing special effects.","Most beautiful time of day. Say the people who stay inside.","Your hands are in your pockets and they're not coming out."],
  "bg-canonical/01082a853faf6df7bb29951b85ec914c4141c0761c5ae0cc36da0f583a50a273.webp": ["Even the seagulls are walking today.","Every one of them is pointing the same way and not one of them chose it.","Not one of them is flying, and that is the whole forecast right there.","The sand is going past them faster than the tide is coming in.","They will stand exactly like that until it drops, and it is not dropping."],
  "bg-canonical/012477e282cc086683649ec1ec90c89d3f0c857d6c8a02d84448f90f0f177ab1.webp": ["Unplug the things. The sky has plans.","The balcony beats the couch when the sky is doing this."],
  "bg-canonical/015fe1a72983fd52e3e589916111385aef136ae928dabd35dc4e30c00ef74461.webp": ["That is the first hadeda up and the entire valley is about to know.","Monday, and the alarm on this farm has feathers and no snooze button.","That sky lasts about six minutes and the bird is the only one watching.","Even the hadedas sound happy.","Africa's sky just hits different.","The sun woke up and chose glorious."],
