  "bg-canonical/08c461c74e9ce38b8691ebe8e3a0e8ddb26ab7bc2383fe23782784314b440539.webp": ["The house is colder inside than outside. Architecture is a beautiful thing.","One patch of sun came into this lounge and the dog got there first."],
  "bg-canonical/09999b1e33e4f7bdafb176e51602254aef7d00d3d96899cd1f2afdb57ea8f4c8.webp": ["Too warm to sleep inside, so the whole family moved under the Milky Way.","Somebody left the light on inside and nobody is going back for it.","The youngest is still awake and has decided the sky is worth it.","Five mattresses on a stoep, and not one of them is a compromise.","Friday night, and the ceiling has been upgraded considerably.","Too hot for walls tonight: the whole family moved the bedroom outside."],
  "bg-canonical/0af3b5a8e364791761c448e994ad918b8d1a69ff13beb72b01f9fb59b5253b06.webp": ["That sprinkler has been the best-value thing in this garden all summer.","Those two on the stoep have made their choice and they are sticking with it.","Nobody is going to remember the temperature, only the sprinkler.","Sunday, and the water bill has already quietly accepted its fate.","The lawn is taking a beating that has nothing to do with the sun."],
