  "bg-canonical/10fb7ce73fa41eddeb139a0609e919c940c6659c4649288153bf549fc05265d4.webp": ["Highveld winter: the only place where you wear two jackets to fetch the post.","Zero wind. Zero clouds. Zero mercy.","The Free State just remembered it has a winter setting."],
  "bg-canonical/11312da815eb96a457a52b90da420cc20a665e644754d0d936e248e053661481.webp": ["The flag is doing its patriotic duty at about sixty kilometres an hour.","That shade sail is one good gust away from becoming a spinnaker.","The palm has given up on symmetry and committed to one direction.","Nobody on this side of Gqeberha is hanging washing out today.","The aloe is unbothered, which is the entire point of an aloe."],
  "bg-canonical/12dc08356d8858edc9b684051c996f4d519977e7e0108a1924f6faebf35096c9.webp": ["Thursday night, and the balcony has been promoted to the main room.","It is cooler out here at midnight than it was inside at six.","The ice in that jug never stood a chance and everybody knew it.","That curtain is the only moving air in the entire flat.","Nobody is going back in there until the walls let go of the day.","Ice in the jug, fan on the chair: the night shift of a forty-degree day."],
