  "bg-canonical/13b538b6e4d9ace67c7b1a097dc91de6f14f3552b3fb8a90de6348bfbbcec4db.webp": ["Somewhere out there people are going for a run right now. Strength to them.","Ja, it's jersey weather. Double jersey.","The grass is wet, the air is cold, and the jersey was not optional."],
  "bg-canonical/13f86b7909396e0e9edd88783197f94bb9412c74a2ce266625862426e234ba76.webp": ["The moon is out and the palms have not stopped moving since sunset.","The moon is holding still and everything else up there is not.","Whatever is landing on that road is not rain, it is the sea arriving sideways.","The palms have been making that noise for hours and nobody is awake to mind.","The road is empty, every light is on, and the wind has the place to itself."],
