  "bg-canonical/16417b9db10c0f9fe76a505d22a040d415546dba6a54122cb69d890c4a3d6be0.webp": ["The sun has arrived. It has not yet started working.","Welkom-cold today. The kind that goes through three jerseys like they aren't there.","Bin day, and the frost got to them before the truck did."],
