  "bg-canonical/1da71cd80b8ecca6b78608f3e61d7374c518e4ba252ff8258c4e4e64265fc422.webp": ["Tomorrow's first task: five minutes of windscreen scraping in your work clothes.","The cars have surrendered. They're sleeping under ice tonight.","Frost on the lawn. Frost on the bakkie. Frost in the pet bowl."],
