  "bg-canonical/243eadef3d4887895250fa67e432b63253ddfc57169498919ed942bead508c96.webp": ["The windpomp has stopped turning, which is how you know the day is over.","That glass has been full for an hour and she is in no hurry.","Sunday, and the Karoo is doing the one thing it does better than anywhere.","The stoep step is still warm and will be for another hour yet.","Nobody has switched a light on inside yet and nobody intends to."],
