  "bg-canonical/336f41869884bd7b62ab2c3e346f56b611c00f4c4ef109fe30b9897c1017cf55.webp": ["The fog took the city but it is not getting the Bo-Kaap's colours."],
  "bg-canonical/3442cc22fc1e323c853666d76576690b9d429950f159c9d4c62f0a3909b15e1e.webp": ["Both hands are on the skirt, which means the hair is on its own.","Table Mountain is right behind her and she cannot see a single bit of it.","That shoe is coming off next and she has run out of hands.","The leaves going past her were still on a tree two streets ago.","Tuesday, and the wind has strong opinions about somebody else's outfit.","Not a hairstyle in sight. Just survivors."],
  "bg-canonical/3561a9c4d6b2427b4b24ff3828531dc948c4c387c54f3372fbff91bf90972872.webp": ["The aloe is not moving and has no intention of starting now.","That thorn tree has been leaning since before anyone on this street arrived.","The dust is going somewhere and it is not asking permission.","Northern Cape wind does not howl. It leans on things until they give.","Everything out here is either properly rooted or already gone.","Sleep tight. The wind will watch the house. Loudly."],
  "bg-canonical/357e2151b07dc48b5749049a908a726b9260cb088de2e3fb443a94aff07b2eb3.webp": ["The weather gods are showing off.","Weekend vibes so strong they need their own playlist.","The evening showed up in its Sunday best."],
  "bg-canonical/360fe761dd56984fe5246331628e0bfc369f64ae903790639d83357d0306cfab.webp": ["The mountain has its cloth on and the palm is holding the pose.","Wednesday, and the Cape Doctor is doing its rounds a little early.","Nobody walks this road at this hour, and tonight nobody wants to.","That palm has been bent that way so long it thinks it is upright.","The whole street is inside pretending the roof noise is normal."],
  "bg-canonical/39021494d6a3f746a0eadcb74e6ab8a2c1f43d05b7ff798d84e319213b77c627.webp": ["The trees are doing involuntary yoga.","That trunk grew crooked because this happens here far more than it doesn't.","The palm has been holding that exact shape since about three this morning.","The Cape Doctor is making house calls.","The sun is up, the street is empty, and the wind got here first.","Table Mountain's tablecloth is out."],
  "bg-canonical/3975a423d9c845b806278cf361bb8042673dbc34479602e62ec84dbadf57e116.webp": ["Clouds looking proper suspicious.","The washing's on the line and you're feeling brave.","Washing's still safe. Probably."],
