  "bg-canonical/3b370a59f9fdefff4b2c898d5ce0863a784e3d3fed71104c791a42be3e822b6d.webp": ["Nobody has been inside that house since about four this afternoon.","The pool has been the only sensible room in the place all day.","Those beers on the edge are on their third owner tonight.","Saturday, and the water is still warmer than the air above it.","The lights went on two hours ago and nobody has suggested moving.","Night swimming is not a plan; it is what this weather leaves you."],
