  "bg/clear/week_1/dawn/5.webp": ["She is watering at seven because by nine it would be a waste.","Not one cloud, which means those geraniums will need this again tonight.","This is the weather we brag about overseas.","Mornings like this are why Capetonians never stop mentioning it.","Zero drama in the sky. Highly unusual. Gladly accepted."],
  "bg/clear/week_1/dawn/7.webp": ["He will move twice before lunch and both times by about a metre.","The sun took its time this morning. Worth the wait.","Enjoy it. There's a cold front out there doing warm-ups."],
