  "bg/clear/week_2/dawn/2.webp": ["The Weber has been watching him water that lawn for twenty minutes now.","Coffee in one hand, hose in the other, and the whole day still ahead.","This is the only twenty minutes of the day that belong to him.","The jacaranda is dropping purple on a lawn he has just finished watering.","Nobody inside that house is awake yet and that is entirely the plan.","This is the weather the weekend was invented for.","Weather this perfect is on loan. The southeaster keeps receipts."],
  "bg/clear/week_2/dawn/5.webp": ["That is the first hadeda up and the entire valley is about to know.","Monday, and the alarm on this farm has feathers and no snooze button.","That sky lasts about six minutes and the bird is the only one watching.","Even the hadedas sound happy.","Africa's sky just hits different.","The sun woke up and chose glorious."],
