  "bg/rain/week_3/day/1.webp": ["The puddle outside the gate is now part of the curriculum."],
  "bg/rain/week_3/day/3.webp": ["Yes, it's raining sideways. South Africa speciality."],
  "bg/rain/week_3/day/5.webp": ["Still raining. That's the whole update.","Wet between here and anywhere else."],
  "bg/rain/week_3/day/7.webp": ["Forgot your jacket? The universe noticed."],
  "bg/rain/week_3/dusk/1.webp": ["Perfect excuse to cancel plans."],
  "bg/rain/week_3/dusk/2.webp": ["Rain on an otherwise good-looking evening.","Wet out. The city can keep the colour."],
  "bg/rain/week_3/dusk/5.webp": ["Joburg rains for twenty minutes, then paints the sky like nothing happened.","Joburg summer rain: arrives at five, soaks everything, gone by supper."],
  "bg/rain/week_3/night/2.webp": ["The frangipani is dropping flowers all over the paving and taking no responsibility.","Monday night, one lit window, and the rain doing all the talking.","That wall has a damp line on it older than tonight's storm.","The burglar bars are the only straight lines left in the whole street.","Somebody inside has already decided they are not going anywhere tonight."],
  "bg/rain/week_3/night/3.webp": ["Every neon sign in the street is being doubled on the wet tar tonight."],
  "bg/rain/week_3/night/4.webp": ["The gutter is carrying this street's problems straight down to the next one.","Jacaranda blossom and stormwater, which is Joburg's least favourite combination.","The electric fence is fine. The pavement has completely given up.","Wednesday, and the drive home is going to be a story by tomorrow.","Every drain on this road is now working on somebody else's behalf.","Sleep tight, dams. You worked hard today.","The pavement is a river and the river has plans.","Rain through a streetlight looks like static, and tonight the whole street is tuned to it."],
  "bg/rain/week_3/night/5.webp": ["The pool is measurably fuller than it was at supper time.","Nobody is going to have to top that up for a month.","The pool light is the only thing in this garden still doing its job.","Tuesday night, and the pool is having a far better time than anyone.","The paving has stopped absorbing anything and is just passing it along.","The pool is being topped up by head office tonight, free of charge.","The only thing swimming tonight is the water itself."],
  "bg/rain/week_3/night/6.webp": ["That umbrella has been closed since the moment it arrived.","Every one of those parking bays was somebody's plan for tonight.","Saturday night at the sea, and the sea has taken the whole promenade.","The painted lines are the only thing out there still holding a shape.","Somebody drove all the way down here to look at this and left."],
  "bg/rain/week_4/dawn/2.webp": ["Somewhere a farmer is doing a small private dance nobody's allowed to see.","The dams get their drink before you get your coffee. Know your place.","Rain out here is an event; the whole veld will smell of it by seven."],
  "bg/rain/week_4/dawn/5.webp": ["Your shoes are about to have a bad day."],
  "bg/rain/week_4/dawn/6.webp": ["Rain on a farm isn't weather. It's a salary falling from the sky.","The dams are doing a happy dance.","One night of proper rain and the driveway has joined the water table."],
  "bg/rain/week_4/day/2.webp": ["Rain came all the way home.","It's proper rain. The day's over in stages."],
  "bg/rain/week_4/day/3.webp": ["The garden's saying dankie at last.","At least the garden's happy. Someone has to be."],
  "bg/rain/week_4/day/4.webp": ["Someone's braai just got ruined."],
  "bg/rain/week_4/dusk/2.webp": ["Still raining. That's the update.","The rain didn't clock off."],
  "bg/rain/week_4/dusk/3.webp": ["The N1 is now a waterpark.","Two drops on a windscreen and the whole N1 forgets everything it ever learned."],
  "bg/rain/week_4/dusk/4.webp": ["Wet socks. The ultimate betrayal."],
  "bg/rain/week_4/dusk/6.webp": ["The commute just became a team sport."],
  "bg/rain/week_4/night/4.webp": ["The traffic just remembered rain exists. Again.","Your car wash was a waste of money.","Night rain maths: half the visibility, double the concentration, triple the respect."],
  "bg/rain/week_4/night/6.webp": ["The gutter is running like a river and it has already claimed a casualty.","The storm water is heading for the sea and taking prisoners."],
