  "bg/storm/week_1/night/4.webp": ["The tree has seen worse Tuesdays and it will see worse again.","Every gate in this street is shut and every dog has an opinion.","Somewhere behind those walls a whole street is pretending to sleep.","The streetlight is doing overtime that nobody is going to pay for.","Tomorrow morning this road will be covered in somebody else's tree.","Even the hadedas are quiet."],
  "bg/storm/week_1/night/5.webp": ["The gutter is telling you exactly how long you left it.","The hose reel is going to feel very unnecessary for a while.","Jacaranda season and a Monday, and the paving is taking both badly.","Whoever parked in the street tonight is regretting it right now.","That security light is doing the best work it has done all year."],
