  "bg/storm/week_2/night/3.webp": ["Friday night, and the stoep has quietly become the whole evening.","That one bulb is holding this entire building together.","The polish on that floor was not designed with this much water in mind.","Everything green out there is having the best night of its life.","You can hear the roof better than you can hear the television.","Somewhere a roof is someone's new kite.","Rain coming off the roof in one solid sheet: the stoep has a curtain tonight."],
  "bg/storm/week_2/night/4.webp": ["That car made it under the carport with about four minutes to spare.","The road is still dry, which is the last thing it will be tonight.","A Free State storm gives you exactly as much warning as it feels like.","Everyone on this street is now standing at a window they never use.","The dust and the rain are about to have a very short argument.","Unplug the TV — it's tradition.","The lightning is putting on a proper show."],
