  "bg/wind/week_3/day/1.webp": ["Those eyes are not closed because of the sun.","Friday, and the aloes have not noticed anything unusual at all.","The trees at the fence are taking this worse than he is.","He will sit there until something more interesting happens, which it will not.","That coat is being parted by something other than a brush."],
  "bg/wind/week_3/day/3.webp": ["That walk was somebody else's idea and the dog is registering a complaint.","Sunday, and this is about as far as either of them is going.","The lead is doing considerably more work than it was designed for.","He is going to shake all that sand out on the lounge carpet later.","The sea has gone white all the way out and he noticed before anyone."],
